  - text: '```"I choose peace."'
    displayText: '"I choose peace."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya said it first, $$but Rika's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. $$They made the same choice.
    displayText: Maya said it first, but Rika's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. They made the same choice.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000004d0000004d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I'm just so tired, $$Maya.$.$. $$I've fought for so long.
    displayText: I'm just so tired, Maya... I've fought for so long.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 130000001300000018000000190000001b0000001b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Nobody really wants it to happen, $$but stuff keeps happening and it keeps
      getting worse and worse.
    displayText: Nobody really wants it to happen, but stuff keeps happening and
      it keeps getting worse and worse.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2200000022000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I know.$.$. $$Everyone tries their best in their own broken way, $$don't
      they.
    displayText: I know... Everyone tries their best in their own broken way, don't
      they.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 07000000080000000a0000000a0000003d0000003d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yeah, $$but that act of trying doesn't reach the other side, $$and their
      attempt at doing their best just broke me more.
    displayText: Yeah, but that act of trying doesn't reach the other side, and their
      attempt at doing their best just broke me more.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000003b0000003b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And Mahiru. $$And everyone else too.$.$.
    displayText: And Mahiru. And everyone else too...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0c0000000c0000002200000023000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I just want it to stop, $$Maya.$.$.
    displayText: I just want it to stop, Maya...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 18000000180000001d0000001e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya hugs her tightly and Rika melts into the touch.
    displayText: Maya hugs her tightly and Rika melts into the touch.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Then let it stop, $$Rika. $$Let's rest here forever, $$I will be here too.
      $$They would be happy to know you've finally escaped the cycle.
    displayText: Then let it stop, Rika. Let's rest here forever, I will be here
      too. They would be happy to know you've finally escaped the cycle.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ba46ecacc866544da47236fc876b59f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1200000012000000180000001800000031000000310000004500000045000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika looks at the open door, $$at the serene field beyond.
    displayText: Rika looks at the open door, at the serene field beyond.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's peaceful there.$.$.
    displayText: It's peaceful there...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1400000015000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yes.
    displayText: Yes.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Forever sounds nice.$.$.
    displayText: Forever sounds nice...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1400000015000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: They walked towards the door, $$hand in hand. $$This is the final choice
      they made by themselves, $$and the only choice that will satisfy her.
    displayText: They walked towards the door, hand in hand. This is the final choice
      they made by themselves, and the only choice that will satisfy her.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000002c0000002c0000005e0000005e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika and Maya step out of the void into the endless field of pear blossoms.
      $$The sweet smell of the air reminds her of home, $$the home she's never had.
    displayText: Rika and Maya step out of the void into the endless field of pear
      blossoms. The sweet smell of the air reminds her of home, the home she's never
      had.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 4c0000004c0000007c0000007c000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The gentle breeze rustles the petals. $$They lie down.
    displayText: The gentle breeze rustles the petals. They lie down.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2600000026000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And for the first time in a long, $$long time, $$Rika feels finally free.
    displayText: And for the first time in a long, long time, Rika feels finally
      free.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 22000000220000002d0000002d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And.$.$.
    displayText: And...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000
    functionCalls: []
