  - text: '```"Today, $$police have confirmed the identity of a girl currently in
      a coma in the XXX Hospital. $$The girl''s name is Konomi Rika, $$the daughter
      of a 40-year-old mother and a 45-year-old father, $$both running a start-up
      cryptocurrency business in Silicon Valley."'
    displayText: '"Today, police have confirmed the identity of a girl currently
      in a coma in the XXX Hospital. The girl''s name is Konomi Rika, the daughter
      of a 40-year-old mother and a 45-year-old father, both running a start-up cryptocurrency
      business in Silicon Valley."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: News Anchor
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 08000000080000005e0000005e0000007e0000007e000000bd000000bd000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "```\"We cannot confirm the whereabouts of the girl's parents at this time.
      $$The doctor reported that the damage to Konomi Rika's brain is irrecoverable,
      $$and there's little to no chance she will regain consciousness\u2014\""
    displayText: "\"We cannot confirm the whereabouts of the girl's parents at this
      time. The doctor reported that the damage to Konomi Rika's brain is irrecoverable,
      and there's little to no chance she will regain consciousness\u2014\""
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: News Anchor
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 47000000470000009400000094000000
    functionCalls: []
