    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: A drop of tear falls from a woman's eye.
    displayText: A drop of tear falls from a woman's eye.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Where has it gone wrong.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Where has it gone wrong..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 190000001a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She's holding a small box. $$A box she should have given to Rika years
      ago. $$There is a note attached to it, $$written in her daughter's deceased
      friend's handwriting.
    displayText: She's holding a small box. A box she should have given to Rika years
      ago. There is a note attached to it, written in her daughter's deceased friend's
      handwriting.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1b0000001b0000004a0000004a0000006a0000006a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The note reads, "You're nice. $$Everyone wants to be friends with you.
      $$Let's have fun together with them in the future!"
    displayText: The note reads, "You're nice. Everyone wants to be friends with
      you. Let's have fun together with them in the future!"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000004500000045000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"If she received this, $$would she smile? $$I really doubt it though.$.$.
      $$She might just be angrier to get something this irritating.$.$."'
    displayText: '"If she received this, would she smile? I really doubt it though...
      She might just be angrier to get something this irritating..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 17000000170000002800000028000000410000004200000044000000440000007f00000080000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The mother lies down in despair.
    displayText: The mother lies down in despair.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Really, $$where has it gone wrong.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Really, where has it gone wrong..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 09000000090000002100000022000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The box hit the ground and it opened a little. A plum blossom spilled out.
    displayText: The box hit the ground and it opened a little. A plum blossom spilled
      out.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Rika.$.$. $$At least you''re smiling.$.$. $$I''m happy for you.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Rika... At least you''re smiling... I''m happy for you..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000070000000900000009000000210000002200000024000000240000003600000037000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika, $$she doesn't know it. $$She doesn't see this plum blossom.
    displayText: Rika, she doesn't know it. She doesn't see this plum blossom.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000001b0000001b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She doesn't see her mother's reaction to her current state.
    displayText: She doesn't see her mother's reaction to her current state.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She doesn't see Mahiru's gift that she never received.
    displayText: She doesn't see Mahiru's gift that she never received.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The world, $$with all its noise and all its pain, $$moves on without her.
